---
---
<section class="py-32 px-6 bg-bg border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">

    <span
      class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-muted font-sans block mb-10"
      data-animate
    >/ DIAGNOSTIC</span>

    <h2
      class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-6xl text-heading leading-tight mb-8"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.1"
    >
      You Already Know Something's Off.
    </h2>

    <p
      class="text-body text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.2"
    >
      The marketing's running. The reviews are strong. The reputation is real. But the phone should be ringing more than it is — and you know it.
    </p>

    <p
      class="text-body text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.25"
    >
      Twelve questions. Ten minutes. Instant results. No sales call unless you want one.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4" data-animate data-delay="0.3">
      <a
        href="/diagnostic/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-bg font-sans font-medium px-10 py-5 text-lg hover:bg-heading transition-colors duration-200"
      >
        Take the Free Diagnostic →
      </a>
      <a
        href="/toolkit"
        class="inline-block border border-accent/50 text-accent font-sans font-medium px-10 py-5 text-lg hover:bg-accent/10 transition-colors duration-200"
      >
        Free Toolkit — 30 Tools →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-16 pt-16 border-t border-border space-y-3 text-subtle text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto"
      data-animate
      data-delay="0.4"
    >
      <p>The diagnostic is free. The results are instant. There is no sales call unless you request one.</p>
      <p>Twelve questions tells us which problem is yours. Then you decide what to do about it.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
